      "writtenOn": "2026-10-13T21:34:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `image2yuvconfig()` function is called by `vpx_codec_encode()` to convert the input image `img` to the internal representation `YV12_BUFFER_CONFIG` used by the libvpx encoder.\n\nAs my comments at lines 127 and 129 show, this function assumes the stride is positive, so it doesn\u0027t support a flipped image.",
      "revId": "79fdc54cad07b7aaf241c559be59493746e43c72",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
